  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize suit matching on the tableau even though it's not required. If you don't keep Spades on Spades, you will quickly find yourself with 10 'blocked' piles that cannot be moved as units.\n\nEmpty Space Utility: Create an empty tableau pile as quickly as possible. This acts as a 'staging area' for breaking up cross-suit stacks and reorganizing them into in-suit sequences.\n\nFoundation Stalling: Don't move a card to the foundations if it can be used on the tableau to build an in-suit sequence. For example, if you have a 4 of Hearts on the tableau and a 5 of Hearts in the waste, don't put it in the foundation yetâ€”use it to free up a Hearts sequence on the tableau.",
    Player: "Prioritize suit matching on the tableau even though it's not required. If you don't keep Spades on Spades, you will quickly find yourself with 10 'blocked' piles that cannot be moved as units.\n\nEmpty Space Utility: Create an empty tableau pile as quickly as possible. This acts as a 'staging area' for breaking up cross-suit stacks and reorganizing them into in-suit sequences.\n\nFoundation Stalling: Don't move a card to the foundations if it can be used on the tableau to build an in-suit sequence. For example, if you have a 4 of Hearts on the tableau and a 5 of Hearts in the waste, don't put it in the foundation yetâ€”use it to free up a Hearts sequence on the tableau.",
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
    riskTolerance: 0.5,
