    basic: "Prioritize suit matching on the tableau even though it's not required. If you don't keep Spades on Spades, you will quickly find yourself with 10 'blocked' piles that cannot be moved as units.",
    intermediate: "Empty Space Utility: Create an empty tableau pile as quickly as possible. This acts as a 'staging area' for breaking up cross-suit stacks and reorganizing them into in-suit sequences.",
